graph TB
    User[User Query] --> Orchestrator[Research Coordinator<br/>GPT-4.1]

    Orchestrator --> WF[Workflow Engine<br/>MCP Runtime]

    WF --> FA[Factual Research Agent<br/>GPT-4.1]
    WF --> TA[Technical Analysis Agent<br/>GPT-4.1]
    WF --> MA[Market Research Agent<br/>GPT-4.1]
    WF --> TMA[Team Research Agent<br/>GPT-4.1]
    WF --> RA[Risk Assessment Agent<br/>GPT-4.1]

    FA --> MCP1[MCP: Web Search]
    TA --> MCP1
    MA --> MCP1
    TMA --> MCP1
    RA --> MCP1

    FA --> MCP2[MCP: Local KB]
    TA --> MCP2
    MA --> MCP2
    TMA --> MCP2
    RA --> MCP2

    MCP1 --> Exa[Exa Search API]
    MCP1 --> OpenAI[OpenAI Search]
    MCP2 --> KB[(Knowledge Base<br/>PostgreSQL + pgvector)]

    FA --> Eval1[DeepEval<br/>Factual Metrics]
    TA --> Eval2[DeepEval<br/>Technical Metrics]
    MA --> Eval3[DeepEval<br/>Market Metrics]
    TMA --> Eval4[DeepEval<br/>Team Metrics]
